  "body_html": "<p>Welcome to Jeminise, where comfort meets personalized style. Our \"Tree of Life\" Quilt Set is designed to bring a touch of meaningful artistry to your home. Featuring the symbolic Yggdrasil design, this quilt set combines beauty with functionality, making it a perfect addition to your bedding collection or a thoughtful gift for cherished loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Selected Design:</strong> Features an amazing Yggdrasil Quilt Design, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for housewarmings, weddings, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or any special occasion, perfect for family and friends.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional and decorative, suitable for use on a bed, wrapping up on the sofa, or for outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, microfibers dry quickly and become fluffier with air drying (without heat).</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Tree of Life in Vintage Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
